WEBVTT

00:12:28.142 --> 00:12:30.042
To je potrebno.

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:35.757
No, neizbježno je da nas bude 2 do 3 milijarde više.

00:12:35.757 --> 00:12:38.969
Stoga, kad raspravljate i kad planirate

00:12:38.969 --> 00:12:42.372
resurse i energiju potrebnu za budućnost,

00:12:42.372 --> 00:12:44.705
za ljude na planetu,

00:12:44.705 --> 00:12:46.862
morate planirati za 10 milijardi ljudi.

00:12:46.862 --> 00:12:49.012
Hvala vam puno.

00:12:49.012 --> 00:12:55.098
(Pljesak)